sequenceDiagram
    participant Plugin as MarketDataProvider (e.g. Binance)
    participant DO as DataOrchestrator (Polly Resilience)
    participant DC as DataCache (CircularBuffer)
    participant DMS as DataManager
    participant DOS as DataOrchestrationService
    participant IO as IndicatorOrchestrator
    participant Store as WorkspaceStore (Redux/Rx)
    participant CR as ChartRenderer (SkiaSharp)
    participant AFC as AccessibilityFeedbackCoordinator
    participant SMM as SonificationManager

    Note over Plugin, DO: Historical Load
    DO->>Plugin: FetchHistoricalAsync(symbol, tf, range)
    Plugin-->>DO: Ohlcv[]
    DO->>DC: SeedCache(bars)
    DO->>DMS: SetData(bars)
    DMS->>Store: Dispatch(SetDataAction)
    Store-->>DOS: StateStream (InitStatus=Ready)
    DOS->>IO: RecalculateFullAsync
    IO->>Store: Dispatch(SetIndicatorDataAction)
    Store-->>CR: StateStream → InvalidateSurface

    Note over Plugin, DO: Live WebSocket Tick
    Plugin->>DO: OnNewTick(Ohlcv)
    DO->>DO: Apply Polly Retry/Circuit Breaker
    DO->>DC: UpdateLiveBar(tick)
    DO->>DMS: UpdateIntraBar / AppendBar
    DMS->>Store: Dispatch(UpdateDataAction)

    par Indicator Recalculation
        Store-->>DOS: StateStream (data changed)
        DOS->>IO: RecalculateLastAsync
        IO->>Store: Dispatch(SetIndicatorDataAction)
    and Accessibility Feedback
        Store-->>AFC: StateStream
        AFC->>AFC: Detect navigation / state changes
        AFC-->>SMM: SyncNavigationSlots (via SonificationManager)
    end

    Store-->>CR: StateStream → InvalidateSurface → OnCanvasPaint

    Note over Plugin, DO: Provider Order Update Stream
    Plugin->>Plugin: UserDataStream / PrivateChannel (Binance/Bitstamp)
    Plugin-->>DO: OrderUpdate event
    DO->>Store: Dispatch(OrderUpdateAction)
    Store-->>AFC: Notify (order filled/cancelled speech)
